  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Review of unep&#xb4;s marine and coastal program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xd6;versyn av unep&#xb4;s marin och kustprogram</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

The purpose of the consultancy is to assess the performance of UNEP in achieving the project objectives for the program &#x201c;Implementation of the UNEP Marine and Coastal Strategy for Africa&#x201d;. Specifically, the review should assess the program&#x2019;s relevance, efficiency, effectiveness and sustainability, lessons-learnt and ultimately propose practical recommendations for actions to be followed-up if a decision is reached for continued support of 5MSEK.

Syftet med konsultuppdraget &#xe4;r att utv&#xe4;rdera UNEPs resultat mot uppsatta projektm&#xe5;l. Mer specifikt ska utv&#xe4;rderingen bed&#xf6;ma projektets relevans, kostnadseffektivitet, &#xf6;vergripande effektivitets- och h&#xe5;llbarhetsaspekter, samt l&#xe4;rdomar fr&#xe5;n projektets g&#xe5;ng. Konsulten ska d&#xe4;rut&#xf6;ver f&#xf6;resl&#xe5; praktiska rekommendationer f&#xf6;r uppf&#xf6;ljning inf&#xf6;r eventuellt f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngt st&#xf6;d om 5MSEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The consultancy will assess performance of UNEP in achieving project  objectives for the program &quot;Implementation of the UNEP Marine and     Coastal Strategy for Africa&quot;. Specifically, the review should assess  the relevance, efficiency, effectiveness and sustainability,          lessons-learnt and ultimately propose recommendations  to be          followed-up if a proposed 5M SEK addition support is disbursed.</narrative>
  </description>
